{"id":"7406c432b6e0ab0d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-lem-key-forcing-prop.md","title":"Key Forcing Property","display":"lem-key-forcing-prop — Key Forcing Property","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-key-forcing-prop","aliases":["58-lem-key-forcing-prop"],"display":"lem-key-forcing-prop — Key Forcing Property","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-key-forcing-prop"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-key-forcing-prop</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-key-forcing-prop — Key Forcing Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,G,D,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(M,P,G,D,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,D\\subseteq P\">\\(G,D\\subseteq P\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}key-forcing-prop} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}key-forcing-prop} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the dense-set conjunct of the defining equivalence for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\)</span>; the forcing order is kept explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4$ and $\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,P,G,D,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"G,D\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}key-forcing-prop} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_S","display":false}],"bytes":848,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3909","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-lem-key-forcing-prop.md|58-lem-key-forcing-prop]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["85bf4cca0e5f1662"]}